      "WeChat configuration declares config_type length 1 while using values 01 and 02, and its success example omits response.sign",
      "WeChat configuration query contains swapped required/length columns in one row, inconsistent APPID lengths and an inner-only success example",
      "WeChat real-name fields marked N contain conditional-required descriptions",
      "WeChat real-name query describes qrcode_data as binary base64, directly renderable image content and an HTML img element at the same time",
      "Alipay real-name application omits a social-organization business_type code and its request example violates its own finance and regional constraints",
